 39	  /// by `core/navigation/app_router.dart`'s `/vault` builder. `true`
 40	  /// (including the default before the boot fetch resolves, Design Notes)
 41	  /// auto-triggers [VaultRepository.authenticate] in [initState] exactly
 42	  /// as before this story; `false` skips straight to the PIN keypad — PIN
 43	  /// remains the access method regardless (Boundaries).
